{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PkYDi5AVRe66XbDVbmgYLG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Feature request: slugify\n2\t\n3\tAdd `slugify(title: string): string` to `src/text.ts` for building URL slugs.\n4\t\n5\tRules:\n6\t1. Lowercase the result.\n7\t2. Remove diacritics (e.g. \"Crème Brûlée\" → \"creme-brulee\").\n8\t3. Any run of characters that are not `a-z` or `0-9` becomes a single `-`.\n9\t4. No leading or trailing `-`.\n10\t5. An input with no letters or digits returns `\"\"`.\n11\t\n12\tExamples: `slugify(\"Hello, World!\")` → `\"hello-world\"`, `slugify(\"  Ship it -- now  \")` → `\"ship-it-now\"`.\n13\t\n14\tConstraints: no new dependencies; existing functions must keep their behavior.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b112bcff-6177-4bb6-8706-5284ac006004","uuid":"02a92096-1dc1-4e1e-a7a4-7cbd7c92c3b8","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:33:28.612Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/m10-tmp/m10-omc-a-3-1792568006243/docs/feature-request.md","content":"# Feature request: slugify\n\nAdd `slugify(title: string): string` to `src/text.ts` for building URL slugs.\n\nRules:\n1. Lowercase the result.\n2. Remove diacritics (e.g. \"Crème Brûlée\" → \"creme-brulee\").\n3. Any run of characters that are not `a-z` or `0-9` becomes a single `-`.\n4. No leading or trailing `-`.\n5. An input with no letters or digits returns `\"\"`.\n\nExamples: `slugify(\"Hello, World!\")` → `\"hello-world\"`, `slugify(\"  Ship it -- now  \")` → `\"ship-it-now\"`.\n\nConstraints: no new dependencies; existing functions must keep their behavior.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
